DESCRIPTION:In memory of the author Marjane Satrapi\, join us for a screen
 ing of Persepolis\, based on her award winning graphic novel.\nThe poignan
 t story of a young girl coming-of-age in Iran during the Islamic Revolutio
 n. Clever and fearless\, she outsmarts the "social guardians" and discover
 s punk\, ABBA and Iron Maiden. Yet when her uncle is senselessly executed 
 and as bombs fall around Tehran in the Iran/Iraq war\, the daily fear that
  permeates life in Iran is palpable.\n2007\, 96 minutes\nRated 14+\nDrop i
 n – no registration needed.\nPersepolis\nPersepolis
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a2700ca703c3363002d2179
