DESCRIPTION:This interactive workshop equips startup and newcomer founders
  to harness gamification for business goals by influencing human behavior.
  Participants will learn core principles\, the 'Circle' framework\, and st
 rategies to overcome challenges using game mechanics.\nA relevant case stu
 dy and collaborative discussion help craft tailored solutions\, followed b
 y a Q&A to wrap-up the workshop for deeper insights.\nNo registration requ
 ired. Space is limited.
