 uo Ishiguro\nApril 8:\nOrbital\nby Samantha Harvey\nMay 13:\nThe Empusium\
 n: A Health Resort Horror Story by Olga Tokarczuk\nJune 10:\nTruth Telling
 \nSeven Conversations About Indigenous Life in Canada by Michelle Good\nJu
 ly 8:\nThree Days in June\nby Anne Tyler\nAugust 12:\nThe Woman in the Lib
 rary\nby Sulari Gentill
