 ooks in a friendly and social atmosphere.\nJuly Book Title:\nKnots and Cro
 sses\nby Ian Rankin\nAugust Book Title:\nThe Laundryman's Boy\nby Edward Y
 .C. Lee\nTo get a copy of the book\, please visit the 1st floor desk at Al
 bert Campbell Library. New members are always welcome.\nDrop-in or registe
 r for a reminder at 416-396-8890 or speak to staff at the desk.
