 y is here June 22 + July 6\, 20 + August 17\, 31.\nSnacks and refreshments
  are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at
  the program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Cent
 re's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
