BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wellness Recovery Action Plan (WRAP)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260904T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260904T160000
UID:6a061f5ac6a1dc3d00d3c003@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:WRAP is for\nanyone\nlooking to strengthen their well-being—
 whether you’re supporting your mental health\, managing stress\, or simp
 ly wanting to feel more balanced and resilient in daily life. Participant
 s will receive a\nWRAP certificate\nupon program completion.\nIn an 8-wee
 k WRAP group\, individuals explore:\nself-care tools like peer connections
 \, relaxation and mindfulness techniques\, stress reduction strategies\, a
 nd more\nresources for keeping well and feeling better in difficult times.
 \nInterested in learning more? Drop in for the information session on\nFri
 day\, August 14 1:00-4:00 pm.\n.\nThis WRAP Group meets\nevery Friday\,\no
 nce a week for 8 weeks\, August 21 to October 9\n. Registration closes aft
 er week 3\, or when full.\nTTC Presto tickets will be provided.\nSnacks an
 d refreshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists will be
  available at the program.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerste
 in Crisis Centre's WRAP initiative\n. Gerstein Crisis Centre is solely res
 ponsible for the protection of \npersonal information collected through th
 e program registration \nprocess.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Discussion Room\, 3rd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a061f5ac6a1dc3d00d3c003
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
