BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Building Your Own Website for Small Business (Focus: Women Entrepr
 eneurs)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260909T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260909T200000
UID:6a2720c943b41b3d006cd0a1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Having a personal website is essential for any small business.
  This\n8-week course\nwill cover everything from the basic fundamentals an
 d tools of WordPress all the way to the platform's advanced features that 
 support promoting and running a small business. Participants are encourage
 d to bring their own laptop\, but it is not required to attend.\nRegistrat
 ion is required for the full series. Participants are expected to attend a
 ll sessions on the following dates:\nJuly 22\nJuly 29\nAugust 5\nAugust 12
 \nAugust 19\nAugust 26\nSeptember 2\nSeptember 9\nThis program is hosted b
 y the Business\, Science and Technology department. Please visit the 3rd f
 loor service desk or call (416) 393-7149 for more information.\nThis progr
 am is part of the\n"Building your own Website for Small Business" Program 
 Series (Women Entrepreneurs stream)\n.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
